\begin_layout Standard
The preference page has three groups:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Data Storage Location:
\series default
 the folder of the downloaded libraries (the Maven cache) and of the fragment libraries: 
\series bold
Installation folder (portable)
\series default
 (in the Bio7 installation, e.g., on a USB stick), 
\series bold
User home folder
\series default
 (Bio7 in the home folder) or 
\series bold
Custom location
\series default
 (
\series bold
Browse...
\series default
). A change needs a restart of Bio7 (the stored data are not moved).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
Dynamic Compiler Libraries:
\series default
 the libraries of the dynamic compiler (available on the classpath of the compiled code): 
\series bold
Add Files...
\series default
, 
\series bold
Scan Directory...
\series default
, 
\series bold
Maven...
\series default
, 
\series bold
Open Location
\series default
 (opens the folder of a selected library) and 
\series bold
Remove
\series default
.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\series bold
OSGi Fragment Libraries:
\series default
 libraries which are loaded as OSGi fragments (available to all plugins of Bio7 at runtime), enabled with 
\series bold
Enable OSGi Fragment Loading
\series default
 (a change needs a restart). 
\series bold
Copy to Fragment Libraries
\series default
 and 
\series bold
Copy to Compiler Libraries
\series default
 copy the selected libraries between the two lists.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
How to Add a Library File
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Open 
\series bold
Preferences Bio7 > Preferences Java Dynamic Compilation > Preferences Libraries
\series default
.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
\series bold
Add Files...
\series default
 selects one or several *.jar files, 
\series bold
Scan Directory...
\series default
 adds all *.jar files of a folder.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Press 
\series bold
Apply and Close
\series default
. The dynamic compiler uses the libraries at the next compilation.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Recalculate the classpath of your Java project for the code completion of the editor (see below).
\end_layout

